\'3f H\u7891\'3f Ch\'ed Minh giao cho c\'e1c ng\'e0nh theo l\u7879\'3fnh ph\'e2n ph\u7889\'3fi c\u7911\'3fa U\u7927\'3f ban K\u7871\'3f ho\u7841\'3f}{\f193\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid10892964\charrsid3042322 ch Nh\'e0 n\'fd}{
